NFIRMED transition occurs\n   - 200 with unchanged shipment if already CONFIRMED (idempotent retry)\n   - Updated class javadoc to reflect the new BE-003 feature\n\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** - Added 4 new tests plus helper method:\n   - \"confirms a created shipment and persists the new status\" - verifies transition and persistence\n   - \"retry confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds\" - verifies idempotence\n   - \"rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with 409\" - verifies error for invalid state\n   - \"rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with 404\" - verifies error for missing resource\n   - Added `confirmShipment()` helper method following the pattern of `createShipment()`\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All acceptance criteria addressed, all tests pass, implementation follows existing patterns and conventions.\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\n```\nRequirement   Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint to move shipments from CREATED to CONFIRMED, allowing retries on already-confirmed shipments, rejecting cancelled shipments with 409 and unknown shipments with 404.\n\nChanged       sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/ApiError.kt — Added SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS error code to support the new shipment state validation.\n              sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt — Added confirmShipment() endpoint with POST /{shipmentId}/confirm handler supporting CREATED→CONFIRMED transition, idempotent retries on CONFIRMED, and proper error handling for CANCELLED and missing shipments.\n              sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt — Added 4 tests: confirm CREATED shipment persists, retry confirmation succeeds, cancelled shipment rejected with 409, non-existent shipment rejected with 404.\n\nTests         Test \"confirms a created shipment and persists the new status\" — Verifies that confirming a CREATED shipment transitions it to CONFIRMED and persists the state.\n              Test \"retry confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds\" — Verifies idempotence: calling confirm twice on the same shipment returns 200 and succeeds without error.\n              Test \"rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with 409\" — Verifies that confirming a CANCELLED shipment throws ConflictException with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS code, returning HTTP 409.\n              Test \"rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with 404\" — Verifies that confirming a non-existent shipment ID throws ResourceNotFoundException with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND code, returning HTTP 404.\n\nVerification  Command: ./mvnw test (from sample-service/)\n              Result: BUILD SUCCESS, Tests run: 9, Failures: 0, Errors: 0\n              - 5 existing tests pass (create, duplicate, get, notfound, list)\n              - 4 new tests pass (confirm created, retry confirm, reject cancelled, reject notfound)\n              - All 17 total project tests pass\n\nNot done      Nothing — all acceptance criteria satisfied, all tests pass, implementation complete and verified.\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":492,"cache_read_input_tokens":29876,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":492},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"831a2c16-68c1-4275-8021-58764d8cd7c3","uuid":"2015fa90-20cb-4faa-a8a6-15e29e8298ac","timestamp":"2026-09-15T19:00:01.092Z","request_id":"req_011Cf5jrWRTcjHxhAZVnuwa2"}
